  "document": "Blanche of Brittany\nBlanche of Brittany( 1271 – 1327) was a daughter of John II, Duke of Brittany, and his wife Beatrice of England. She is also known as Blanche de Dreux. Through her mother she was the granddaughter of King Henry III of England and Eleanor of Provence."
